<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16363" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσπ-αστός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσπάσιος</span>
			, <i>welcome,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> (only in <i><span class="en">
				Od.
			</span></i>), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ὀδυσῆ᾽ ἀσπαστὸν ἔδυ φάος ἠελίοιο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					13.35
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				5.398
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				23.239
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάρτα ἀ. [τὸ πρᾶγμα] ἐποιήσαντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					5.98
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖσι ἡ τυραννὶς πρὸ ἐλευθερίης ἦν
					ἀσπαστότερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.62
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				348
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				Them.
				<u>Or.</u>
				15.184d
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			). Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.201
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				1090
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ τῆς ζωῆς ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					3p.61U.
				</span></i>
			; neut. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσπαστόν</span> as
				Adv., <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				42
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to be welcomed,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phlb.</u>
				32d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσπαστον, τό,</span> an instrument of uncertain use, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				544.25
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii/iii A.D.)</span>.</div>
